SUGYA-LEVEL EXEGETICAL ANALYSIS

====================================================

After analyzing every source individually,

perform a second analysis of the sugya as a whole.

Determine

primary_textual_theme

What is the main interpretive problem?

primary_hermeneutic_method

Which interpretive method dominates the sugya?

development_of_interpretation

Describe how the Gemara develops its reading over the course of the sugya.

relationship_between_sources

How do all of the cited sources work together?

overall_argument_progression

How do the textual interpretations build the overall argument?

overall_message

What larger lesson is produced through these interpretations?

why_this_sugya_is_structured_this_way

Explain why these sources appear in this order.

textual_strategy

Summarize the Gemara's overall strategy for reading Scripture and earlier authorities.

